WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:13.631
Kinship now has Seismic settings. Every worker installs with bun, runs the type check and the tests, and starts the app the same way: on a free port of its own, with fresh demo data. This app was started exactly like that.

00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:23.983
There is no sign in. Every request acts as Jordan Lee, who is in four clubs and has thirteen plans, so a demo shows real data at once.

00:00:24.941 --> 00:00:33.541
Club pages, events and RSVPs work as usual. Jordan organizes Sourdough Society, a good place to show organizer features.

00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:40.658
Workers can now set up, check, run and stop Kinship without asking, and the allow list is ready to review.
